{"unit_id": "tag:02LA:proof", "translation": "有限（finite）态射（morphism）就是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的整（integral）态射（morphism），见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>。因此，结合引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>即可得到本引理。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "有限态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考察的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "有限态射的刻画，待决"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "有限态射的刻画，待决"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章名，待决"}], "notes": ["remark：原文开头An finite morphism的冠词有语法笔误；数学内容忠实保留。"]}
