{"unit_id": "tag:02VI:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），使得每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>都是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的。我们已知（引理<REF_0001>），“局部有限型（locally of finite type）”在基底（base）上是fpqc局部（local）的，所以可知<MATH_0004>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。于是由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>可得<MATH_0005>是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的。拟有限（quasi-finite）的情形由此得到，因为我们已知“拟紧（quasi-compact）”在基底（base）上是fpqc局部（local）的（引理<REF_0003>）。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射对象，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "下降的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖", "context": "下降所用覆盖，待决"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "覆盖下的基变换，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限", "context": "下降的性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "已知可下降的性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "局部性所在基底，待决"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "fpqc局部性，待决"}, {"s