{"unit_id": "tag:02VK:proof", "translation": "态射（morphism）是合成（syntomic）的，当且仅当它是局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）的、平坦（flat）的，且其纤维（fibres）都是局部完全交（locally complete intersections）。我们已知，平坦（flat）与局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）在基底（base）上都是fpqc局部（local）的（引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>）。因此，由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>得到合成（syntomic）的情形的结论。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "locally complete intersections", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考察的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成", "context": "syntomic态射的暂定译法，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现", "context": "态射有限性，待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射平坦性，待决"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "态射的纤维，待决"}, {"source_term": "locally complete intersections", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "纤维性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "局部性所在基底，待决"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "fpqc局部性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章名，待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02VL:statement", "translation": "性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是光滑（smooth）的”在基底（base）上是fpqc局部（local）的。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "态射性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "局部性所在基底，待决"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "fpqc局部性，待决"}], "notes": []}
